    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loving tribute to classic first person narrative games and obscure Source engine mods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of playing games that actually <i>make sense</i>? Are you craving something that's equal parts walking, existential crisis, and jokes about the very fact that you paid money to experience an existential crisis? Well, do I have something for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presenting <strong>DO NOT PRESS THE BUTTON</strong>: a walking simulator where the walking is optional, the simulation is questionable, and the comedy is 100% guaranteed to make you chuckle awkwardly while questioning all your life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Is there a deep, philosophical meaning to this game?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows! Probably not! But it will definitely <i>pretend</i> there is, and you\u2019ll go along with it, because you\u2019re curious like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Revolutionary mechanics?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s just say, if you\u2019ve ever wanted to press buttons with absolutely no clue what they do, THIS is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c17511f298b98b9a6b8f82514f92dd15.poster.avif?t=1745838828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c17511f298b98b9a6b8f82514f92dd15.webm?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c17511f298b98b9a6b8f82514f92dd15.mp4?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic narrative-driven games,  Do Not Press The Button (Or You'll Delete The Multiverse) challenges the conventions of storytelling and player agency, inviting players into a universe where every action leads to unexpected (and often humorous) consequences.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Theseus Games' third title, and by now, we've specialized in the advanced field of wacky game mechanics. After all, our previous releases include <i>Pizza Synthwave</i> and <i>Be a Rock</i>. For a more complete and in-depth understanding of what Do Not Press The Button is, check out the free demo.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will have the choice of how to play and what to do, it\u2019s about  you and your misdirected shenanigans against The Developer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c5f49378d00840314e775a137afe2921.poster.avif?t=1745838828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c5f49378d00840314e775a137afe2921.webm?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c5f49378d00840314e775a137afe2921.mp4?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are looking for the person that can set the record for not pressing the button the longest. Don't forget to annoy The Developer along the way! Estimated gameplay time: up to 1 billion years (or however long human civilization lasts). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/34d949eb1aa84fc5dd9960b52cecd3b4.poster.avif?t=1745838828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/34d949eb1aa84fc5dd9960b52cecd3b4.webm?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/34d949eb1aa84fc5dd9960b52cecd3b4.mp4?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> <br>- Fun activities such as:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; The Room With All The People That Want To Hang Out With You; <br>&gt; The Introspective Therapy room;  &gt; The Boxtopia room;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; The Dark Humor room;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   &gt; The Meaning Of Human Existence room; <br>&gt; Interact with random physical objects inside the facility; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Secret areas with secret content that developer don't want you to find; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Comedic narration and fun story telling; <br>- Secret Do Not Press The Button (tm) lore (tm); <br>- Hundreds of voiced lines; <br>- Annoying The Developer; <br>- Wacky Multiverses; <br>- Accessibility: we value accessibility and strive to ensure that everyone can enjoy our game, regardless of any hearing impairments they may have. That's why we've made sure that every voice line in the game features subtitles, so that all players can fully immerse themselves in the experience.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, we're not asking you to solve complex equations here. You just have to not press a button. It's an average job for an average person. You've trained all your life for this moment. Go in there and shine my little mediocre moth! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. &quot;I have no idea what I'm doing with my life anymore!&quot; - The Dev</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loving tribute to classic first person narrative games and obscure Source engine mods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you tired of playing games that actually <i>make sense</i>? Are you craving something that's equal parts walking, existential crisis, and jokes about the very fact that you paid money to experience an existential crisis? Well, do I have something for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presenting <strong>DO NOT PRESS THE BUTTON</strong>: a walking simulator where the walking is optional, the simulation is questionable, and the comedy is 100% guaranteed to make you chuckle awkwardly while questioning all your life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Is there a deep, philosophical meaning to this game?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows! Probably not! But it will definitely <i>pretend</i> there is, and you\u2019ll go along with it, because you\u2019re curious like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Revolutionary mechanics?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s just say, if you\u2019ve ever wanted to press buttons with absolutely no clue what they do, THIS is your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c17511f298b98b9a6b8f82514f92dd15.poster.avif?t=1745838828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c17511f298b98b9a6b8f82514f92dd15.webm?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c17511f298b98b9a6b8f82514f92dd15.mp4?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic narrative-driven games,  Do Not Press The Button (Or You'll Delete The Multiverse) challenges the conventions of storytelling and player agency, inviting players into a universe where every action leads to unexpected (and often humorous) consequences.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Theseus Games' third title, and by now, we've specialized in the advanced field of wacky game mechanics. After all, our previous releases include <i>Pizza Synthwave</i> and <i>Be a Rock</i>. For a more complete and in-depth understanding of what Do Not Press The Button is, check out the free demo.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will have the choice of how to play and what to do, it\u2019s about  you and your misdirected shenanigans against The Developer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c5f49378d00840314e775a137afe2921.poster.avif?t=1745838828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c5f49378d00840314e775a137afe2921.webm?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/c5f49378d00840314e775a137afe2921.mp4?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are looking for the person that can set the record for not pressing the button the longest. Don't forget to annoy The Developer along the way! Estimated gameplay time: up to 1 billion years (or however long human civilization lasts). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/34d949eb1aa84fc5dd9960b52cecd3b4.poster.avif?t=1745838828\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/34d949eb1aa84fc5dd9960b52cecd3b4.webm?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336120/extras/34d949eb1aa84fc5dd9960b52cecd3b4.mp4?t=1745838828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> <br>- Fun activities such as:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; The Room With All The People That Want To Hang Out With You; <br>&gt; The Introspective Therapy room;  &gt; The Boxtopia room;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; The Dark Humor room;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   &gt; The Meaning Of Human Existence room; <br>&gt; Interact with random physical objects inside the facility; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Secret areas with secret content that developer don't want you to find; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Comedic narration and fun story telling; <br>- Secret Do Not Press The Button (tm) lore (tm); <br>- Hundreds of voiced lines; <br>- Annoying The Developer; <br>- Wacky Multiverses; <br>- Accessibility: we value accessibility and strive to ensure that everyone can enjoy our game, regardless of any hearing impairments they may have. That's why we've made sure that every voice line in the game features subtitles, so that all players can fully immerse themselves in the experience.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, we're not asking you to solve complex equations here. You just have to not press a button. It's an average job for an average person. You've trained all your life for this moment. Go in there and shine my little mediocre moth! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S. &quot;I have no idea what I'm doing with my life anymore!&quot; - The Dev</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person, narrative-driven game featuring The Developer, who questions, taunts, and tests you at every turn. You shouldn\u2019t press the button, but you\u2019ll want to. You will have control, and you will have none. Power is in your hands... or is it? Inspired by classic narrative driven games.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cOne the best representation of buttons in a game. You press a button and something happens! Now that is accuracy!\u201d<br />\r\n10/10 \u2013 The World Button Association <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cMe: &quot;Brain, we need to write (new book chapter).&quot; Brain: &quot;Okay, we're going to write...&quot; Me: &quot;Finally!&quot; Brain: &quot;... A new poem for Do Not Press The Button&quot; Me: &quot;GAWDDAMMIT.&quot; (We don't let them go out much)\u201d<br />\r\n91% \u2013 Our Discord Community <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cIt is a game and I am in it. Now please don't bother me with this nonsense anymore.\u201d<br />\r\nIt's OK. \u2013 The Humorless Toaster<br />\r\n",
